{"ref":"powerup:recovery","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":128,"h":110,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Recovery is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It determines the amount of health that is regenerated per second."]},{"k":"p","c":["The base value of Recovery is 0, which means that health does not regenerate without any Recovery bonuses. Recovery also boosts healing from pickups, each 0.1 translates to an additive 10% boost. It does not always increase healing from weapons. Bonuses to Recovery are flat bonuses and thus stack additively."]},{"k":"p","c":["There is no upper limit to how much Recovery the player can have."]},{"k":"p","c":["Recovery also affects:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Base damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Sharp_Tongue.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sharp-tongue"}," ",{"t":"Sharp Tongue","r":"weapon:sharp-tongue"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Tongue.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"arcana:gemini-i"}," ",{"t":"Silver Tongue","r":"arcana:gemini-i"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Impostongue.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:impostongue"}," ",{"t":"Impostongue","r":"weapon:impostongue"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"}]},{"c":["Base damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Star_Flail.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:star-flail"}," ",{"t":"Star Flail","r":"weapon:star-flail"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Moon_Rod.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:moon-rod"}," ",{"t":"Moon Rod","r":"weapon:moon-rod"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}]},{"c":["Healing effect of ",{"i":"Sprite-Lifesign_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," ",{"t":"Lifesign Scan","r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"}]},{"c":["Healing effect of ",{"i":"Sprite-Refectio.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"weapon:refectio"}," ",{"t":"Refectio","r":"weapon:refectio"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Sanctuary.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sanctuary"}," ",{"t":"Sanctuary","r":"weapon:sanctuary"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}]}]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["2 January 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["REGEN"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+0.1"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+0.5"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 200"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Recovery PowerUp increases Recovery by 0.1 per rank, with a maximum rank of 5. At rank 5, it provides +0.5 Recovery. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 200."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Rank"],"h":1},{"c":["Recovery"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+0.1"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+0.2"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+0.3"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["+0.4"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["+0.5"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Recovery's associated passive item is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pummarola.png","w":18,"h":15,"r":"passive:pummarola"}," ",{"t":"Pummarola","r":"passive:pummarola"},", which provides +0.2 Recovery per level, up to a maximum of +1 Recovery at level 5."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Left.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Left","r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," also provides +0.1 Recovery per level, up to a maximum of +0.8 Recovery at level 9."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Pearl_magatama.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"passive:pearl-magatama"}," ",{"t":"Pearl magatama","r":"passive:pearl-magatama"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheMoonSpell.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access"}," provides +0.5 recovery every other level, up to a maximum of +1.5 recovery at level 6."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Centralis_Custos.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:centralis-custos"}," ",{"t":"Centralis Custos","r":"weapon:centralis-custos"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," provides +2 Recovery when the player character takes damage from enemies."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Trinum_Custodem.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:trinum-custodem"}," ",{"t":"Trinum Custodem","r":"weapon:trinum-custodem"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," provides a passive +2 Recovery and an additional +2 Recovery when the player character takes damage from enemies."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Golden_Egg.png","w":22,"h":24}," Golden Egg permanently increases Recovery by 0.1 for the character that collected it."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-darkana","title":"From darkana","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Crystal_Cries_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"}," ",{"t":"Crystal Cries (XII)","r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"}," generates crystals when killing frozen enemies that can be collected to slightly increase ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", Recovery, and ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-characters","title":"From characters","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"from-characters-base-game","title":"Base Game","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Suor_Clerici.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:suor-clerici"}," ",{"t":"Clerici","r":"character:suor-clerici"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Minnah_Mannarah.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:minnah-mannarah"}," ",{"t":"Minnah","r":"character:minnah-mannarah"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Bat_Robbert.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:bat-robbert"}," ",{"t":"Robbert","r":"character:bat-robbert"}," start with +0.5 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Divano_Thelma.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:divano-thelma"}," ",{"t":"Divano","r":"character:divano-thelma"}," starts with +1 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Smith_IV.png","w":18,"h":19,"r":"character:smith-iv"}," ",{"t":"Smith","r":"character:smith-iv"}," gains +0.01 Recovery every level, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Cosmo_Pavone.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:cosmo-pavone"}," ",{"t":"Cosmo","r":"character:cosmo-pavone"}," starts with +1 Recovery and gains +1 Recovery every level, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Queen_Sigma.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:queen-sigma"}," ",{"t":"Sigma","r":"character:queen-sigma"}," starts with +3 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Poe_Ratcho.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," ",{"t":"Retired Poe Ratcho","r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," starts with +5 Recovery and a Level 5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Pummarola.png","w":18,"h":15,"r":"passive:pummarola"}," ",{"t":"Pummarola","r":"passive:pummarola"}," which provides an additional +1 Recovery."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-legacy-of-the-moonspell","title":"Legacy of the Moonspell","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Miang_Moonspell.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:miang-moonspell"}," ",{"t":"Miang","r":"character:miang-moonspell"}," starts with +1 Recovery."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-tides-of-the-foscari","title":"Tides of the Foscari","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Luminaire_Foscari.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:luminaire-foscari"}," ",{"t":"Luminaire","r":"character:luminaire-foscari"}," starts with +0.5 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sammy.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:sammy"}," ",{"t":"Sammy","r":"character:sammy"}," starts with +2 Recovery."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-emergency-meeting","title":"Emergency Meeting","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Crewmate_Dino.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:crewmate-dino"}," ",{"t":"Crewmate","r":"character:crewmate-dino"}," has a chance to gain a random amount of Recovery every time a weapon or passive item is upgraded to its maximum level, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Shapeshifter_Nino.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:shapeshifter-nino"}," ",{"t":"Shapeshifter","r":"character:shapeshifter-nino"}," starts with +1 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Guardian_Pina.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:guardian-pina"}," ",{"t":"Guardian","r":"character:guardian-pina"}," starts with +0.1 Recovery and provides +0.1 Recovery to nearby characters."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Scientist_Mina.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:scientist-mina"}," ",{"t":"Scientist","r":"character:scientist-mina"}," can select to gain +0.01 Recovery per level every 10 levels until level 50, for a maximum of up to +0.05 Recovery per level."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-operation-guns","title":"Operation Guns","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Lucia_Zero.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:lucia-zero"}," ",{"t":"Lucia","r":"character:lucia-zero"}," starts with +1 Recovery and gains +0.1 Recovery after ",{"t":"reviving","r":"powerup:revival"},", with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sheena_Etranzi.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:sheena-etranzi"}," ",{"t":"Sheena","r":"character:sheena-etranzi"}," starts with +1 Recovery."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-ode-to-castlevania","title":"Ode to Castlevania","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Mina_Hakuba.png","w":19,"h":24,"r":"character:mina-hakuba"}," ",{"t":"Mina","r":"character:mina-hakuba"}," starts with +0.5 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Wind.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:wind"}," ",{"t":"Wind","r":"character:wind"}," starts with +1 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Keremet.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"character:keremet"}," ",{"t":"Keremet","r":"character:keremet"}," starts with +2 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Julia_Laforeze.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"character:julia-laforeze"}," ",{"t":"Julia","r":"character:julia-laforeze"}," starts with +3 Recovery."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Joachim_Armster.png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"character:joachim-armster"}," ",{"t":"Joachim","r":"character:joachim-armster"}," can select to gain +0.01 Recovery per level."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Blackmore.png","w":19,"h":24,"r":"character:blackmore"}," ",{"t":"Blackmore","r":"character:blackmore"}," can select to gain +0.01 Recovery per level after defeating 1000, 5000, 9000, 13000 and 17000 enemies, for a maximum of up to +0.05 Recovery per level."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sara_Trantoul.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:sara-trantoul"}," ",{"t":"Sara","r":"character:sara-trantoul"}," gains +0.02 Recovery every level, without cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Leon_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:leon-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Leon","r":"character:leon-belmont"}," gains +0.1 Recovery upon obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Vampire_Killer.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vampire-killer"}," ",{"t":"Vampire Killer","r":"weapon:vampire-killer"},"."]}]}]}]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Recovery is additive and not multiplicative. The highest possible Recovery is attainable by playing as ",{"t":"Cosmo","r":"character:cosmo-pavone"},", with rank 5 Recovery PowerUp (+0.5), level 5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Pummarola.png","w":18,"h":15,"r":"passive:pummarola"}," ",{"t":"Pummarola","r":"passive:pummarola"}," (+1), and level 9 ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Left.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Left","r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," (+0.8), combining to give the character (player level+3.3) health regenerated every second. It can be doubled with ",{"i":"Sprite-Sarabande_of_Healing_(VI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"}," ",{"t":"Sarabande of Healing (VI)","r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"}," to (2 x player level + 6.6) every second."]},{"c":["The small amount of Recovery may look weak, but it can be very useful for healing off small bits of damage. Anything that makes the player take less damage will thus make the Recovery more effective, such as bonuses to ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 20 October 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["\"Recovery\" stat now also affects the potency of health recovery pickups."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 2 January 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game (powerup)."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 27 October 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game (stat)."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}